 "notes": [
  "Starting cards as posted under 'Starting (8)': Endor Operations / Imperial Outpost, Endor, Endor: Bunker, Endor: Landing Platform (Docking Bay), Operational As Planned, Death Star II, Moff Jerjerrod and Imperial Arrest Order; these count toward the 60. Operational As Planned takes the Death Star II system, Jerjerrod and any Effect into hand; Imperial Arrest Order is that Effect (the strategy: '1st Turn ... toss down IAO and the DS2').",
  "The line 'DS2Ops' above the starting section is the deck's name, not a card.",
  "Endor, Endor: Bunker, Endor: Landing Platform (Docking Bay), Tatooine (Premiere), Tatooine: Docking Bay 94, Spaceport Docking Bay and Tatooine: Cantina use the Dark printings; Death Star II is the Dark system.",
  "Posted 'Tatooine DB' dested Tatooine: Docking Bay 94 and 'Spaceport DB' dested Spaceport Docking Bay (the strategy deploys 'the Spaceport DB on Tatooine' as a second Tatooine docking bay); 'Death Star II DB' dested Death Star II: Docking Bay; 'DS2 Capacitors / Coolant Shaft / Reactor Core' dested the Death Star II sites.",
  "Posted 'Bossk in Bus' dested Bossk In Hound's Tooth; 'Mara Jade' dested Mara Jade, The Emperor's Hand; 'Darth Maul' is the Tatooine card.",
  "Secret Plans is a Special Edition Effect in 2001 (not a Defensive Shield).",
  "The section counts as posted (8+11+7+16+2+3+6+6+1) total 60."
